# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & Canonical Routing
# Note: Cloudflare Pages natively routes unmatched SPA requests to /index.html (200 OK) when no top-level 404.html is present.
/developer        /developers   301
/developer/*      /developers/:splat 301
/blogs/*          /             301
/blog/*           /             301
/blogs            /             301
/blog             /             301
